cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: kyt-gate
abstract: >-
  Policy-as-code gate for stablecoin and token transfers.
  Token allowlist with GENIUS Act status, address lists with freshness dates, exposure thresholds, FinCEN special measures and Travel Rule completeness, with a replay that compares two policies on labelled history. Tested on synthetic data only.
authors:
